# CVEs Trivy may skip in the image scan (build-image-stage.yml, build-image-prod.yml).
# Only for a vulnerability with no fixed package available yet. One ID per line,
# with a comment: package, fixed version, and when to remove the line.
# The image refreshes apk packages daily (APK_REFRESH), so a fixed package is
# picked up on the next day's build.
